onboarding-resources-title = Watch and recover resources
onboarding-resources-detail = Resource pools and costs are shown in the Abilities panel. Resting can recover supported pools but may be interrupted.
onboarding-resources-control = Use Rest in the Abilities panel when recovery is useful.
onboarding-messages-title = Use the message history
onboarding-messages-detail = Command results, rejections, combat, and journey transitions appear chronologically in Messages.
onboarding-messages-control = Perform an action and verify its localized result in the Messages panel.
onboarding-save-title = Create a native checkpoint
onboarding-save-detail = Native saves preserve authoritative state and can be discovered from the title screen before a new session.
onboarding-save-control = Enter a save name in Native Saves and choose Create.

