trait-scope-current-ammunition = Current ammunition
trait-scope-own-weapon = This weapon only
trait-scope-rule-armed-melee = Applies to weapon-sourced melee under current rules, using non-tool equipment and timed brands. The strongest applicable multiplier is used; slays and brands are not all added. This does not imply unarmed, shooting or throwing effects.
trait-scope-rule-current-ammunition = Applies to ammunition selected by the current projectile profile. Shooting reads ammunition slays and brands, not matching traits on the launcher or other equipment.
trait-scope-rule-own-weapon = Vampiric healing is checked for qualifying melee damage dealt with this weapon, not other weapons or all attacks.
trait-no-attack-sources = No known attack-trait sources.
trait-attack-guide = Shows concrete sources and actual scope. Only known, implemented effects are listed; unprojected effects and aura damage numbers are not guessed.
