trait-known-shot-bonus = Known base-shot modifier: { $value } percentage points
trait-weapon-selection-rule = Items are shown individually, not as separate active attacks. Current regular melee selects one weapon; slays, brands and attack-count modifiers from other non-tool equipment still follow shared melee rules. Draconian metamorphosis can replace regular melee with innate attacks.
trait-launcher-selection-rule = Shooting uses the selected launcher and compatible ammunition. This modifier belongs to this launcher, not every weapon.
