trait-unit-energy = { $value } energy
trait-melee-rate-rule = Read directly from the regular melee profile. The fractional part is the chance of one extra attack: 1.96 means one attack plus a 96% chance of another. The minimum is 0.00. Sources show effective adjustments; innate attacks and action-specific techniques are excluded. Totals affected by unidentified equipment are withheld.
trait-shot-rate-rule = Taken from the selected launcher's core projectile profile. Base shot rate and energy cost determine firing frequency, not automatic extra projectiles per command. This page does not reverse-engineer hidden contributions.
trait-auras = Contact auras
trait-aura-fire = Fire aura
trait-aura-electricity = Electricity aura
trait-aura-cold = Cold aura
trait-aura-holy = Contact retaliation (evil targets only)
trait-contact-scope = Character contact retaliation
trait-aura-rule = Triggered by qualifying enemy contact attacks, not added to every weapon attack. Targets with ordinary/strong resistance or immunity skip that elemental retaliation. Overlapping timed sources are combined by the core. Damage is not estimated here.
trait-holy-aura-rule = Retaliates after qualifying contact attacks only against evil targets without resist-all, using the core mana-damage path. It is not a global melee damage brand.
trait-no-auras = No currently active projected contact auras.
