mogaminator-help-title = Rule help
mogaminator-help-order = Rules match from top to bottom and the first match wins. Lines starting with # are comments; ?: changes the condition for following rules.
mogaminator-help-actions = No prefix picks up; ~ leaves; ! destroys; ; asks; ( hides from the object list; ? identifies first; #text adds an inscription.
mogaminator-help-language = Rule language follows the interface language. Each character stores separate Chinese and English rules; import, export, and restore affect the current language only, and Apply validates the whole source atomically in Core.
mogaminator-import = Import current-language rules
mogaminator-export = Export current-language rules
mogaminator-import-error = The selected rule file could not be read.
mogaminator-reset = Restore defaults for this language
mogaminator-apply = Apply
mogaminator-match-summary = { $count } known items currently match.
mogaminator-line-draft = Rules changed. Apply them for Core validation and line details.
mogaminator-line-empty = Line { $line } is empty.
mogaminator-line-blank = Line { $line }: blank.
mogaminator-line-comment = Line { $line }: comment.
mogaminator-line-condition = Line { $line }: replaces the active condition for following rules.
mogaminator-line-rule = Line { $line }: { $action }; { $predicates } predicates; name search “{ $search }”.
